<!doctype lake><title>教案01-C语言概述与环境搭建</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1 data-lake-id="gDIl2" id="gDIl2"><span data-lake-id="u0eabeee6" id="u0eabeee6">1.C语言概述</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id="e1kMt" id="e1kMt"><span data-lake-id="ua0bf4dfc" id="ua0bf4dfc">1.1 c语言历史与特性</span></h2><p data-lake-id="21f7da216665b13ee8bc6a4ebf04c3f6" id="21f7da216665b13ee8bc6a4ebf04c3f6"><span data-lake-id="u9e9f8ee7" id="u9e9f8ee7" class="lake-fontsize-12">一提到语言这个词语，自然会想到的是像英语，汉语等这样的自然语言，因为它是人和人交换信息不可缺少的</span><span data-lake-id="ua953c4b9" id="ua953c4b9" class="lake-fontsize-12">工具</span><span data-lake-id="u6d94f263" id="u6d94f263" class="lake-fontsize-12">。而C语言就是人和计算机交流的一种语言，语言有独特的语法规则和定义，双方必须遵守这些规则和定义才能实现真正的交流。</span></p><p data-lake-id="2da99d96c96824df83a85e010c72ff0e" id="2da99d96c96824df83a85e010c72ff0e"><span data-lake-id="u6f48c82e" id="u6f48c82e" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="cbeb9a3311d8a91f328898ca2a3a5f9b" id="cbeb9a3311d8a91f328898ca2a3a5f9b"><span data-lake-id="u5e82a831" id="u5e82a831" class="lake-fontsize-12">C 语言是一种通用的程序设计语言。它同 UNIX 系统之间具有非常密切的联系——C 语言 是在 UNIX 系统上开发的，并且，无论是 UNIX 系统本身还是其上运行的大部分程序，都是 用 C 语言编写的。但是，C 语言并不受限于任何一种操作系统或机器。由于它很适合用来编 写编译器和操作系统，因此被称为“系统编程语言”，但它同样适合于编写不同领城中的大多数 程序。</span></p><p data-lake-id="dbb8ac7898426cab63b743c59fa54c51" id="dbb8ac7898426cab63b743c59fa54c51"><span data-lake-id="ucaa1e26f" id="ucaa1e26f" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言于1969年至1973年间，为了移植与开发UNIX作业系统，由丹尼斯·里奇与肯·汤普逊（</span><span data-lake-id="u0a2bac2a" id="u0a2bac2a" class="lake-fontsize-12">同为1983年图灵奖得主</span><span data-lake-id="u204ed2bc" id="u204ed2bc" class="lake-fontsize-12">），以B语言为基础，在贝尔实验室设计、开发出来。二十世纪八十年代，C语言应用日渐广泛。</span></p><p data-lake-id="cac62e9ed5d55882a126e40d0af52308" id="cac62e9ed5d55882a126e40d0af52308" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560070652-53616f22-27d4-419b-9b4b-47f50d8a81e1.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A513%2C%22height%22%3A258%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A640%2C%22originHeight%22%3A322%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23292625%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LRFFx%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="3b51c762bfe90fd70bdfa1800d244f00" id="3b51c762bfe90fd70bdfa1800d244f00"><span data-lake-id="u5c639d8b" id="u5c639d8b" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言具有高效、灵活、功能丰富、表达力强和较高的可移植性等特点，在程式设计中备受青睐，成为最近25年使用最为广泛的编程语言。目前，C语言编译器普遍存在于各种不同的操作系统中，例如Microsoft Windows、macOS、Linux、Unix等。C语言的设计影响了众多后来的程式语言，例如C++、Objective-C、Java、C#等。现行的许多软件都是由C语言或者其影响和衍生的编程语言开发出来的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="190e08da680314cda3a9bcb8a1c872e7" id="190e08da680314cda3a9bcb8a1c872e7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560070889-4e8a6bbe-5c9d-4310-a0df-2d62d92be118.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A306%2C%22height%22%3A386%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A640%2C%22originHeight%22%3A807%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eae9f0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Cn9l7%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="c01f53d46a5c8d8c6b49c58e26f4c1ec" id="c01f53d46a5c8d8c6b49c58e26f4c1ec"><span data-lake-id="u427d7e88" id="u427d7e88" class="lake-fontsize-12">任何比C语言更低级的语言，都不足以完整地抽象一个计算机系统；任何比C高级的语言，都可以用C来实现——C语言之父Dennis MacAlistair Ritchie</span></p><p data-lake-id="4845dfd12f76c13bcebf688deab983f7" id="4845dfd12f76c13bcebf688deab983f7"><span data-lake-id="u3b4c278d" id="u3b4c278d" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="RAQg1" id="RAQg1"><span data-lake-id="u248c22e8" id="u248c22e8">1.2 廉颇老矣？</span></h2><p data-lake-id="140ff8a79a4962de16971f870ab5c9b8" id="140ff8a79a4962de16971f870ab5c9b8"><span data-lake-id="u400d7ed2" id="u400d7ed2" class="lake-fontsize-12">《史记·廉颇蔺相如列传》记载，廉颇被免职后，跑到魏国，赵王想再用他，派人去看他的身体情况，廉颇之仇郭开贿赂使者，使者看到廉颇，廉颇为之米饭一斗，肉十斤，被甲上马，以示尚可用。使者回来报告赵王说:&quot;廉颇将军虽老，尚善饭，然与臣坐，顷之三遗矢(通假字，即屎)矣。&quot;赵王以为廉颇已老，遂不用。</span></p><p data-lake-id="eabd1e6bbae1bfb065247b3646156510" id="eabd1e6bbae1bfb065247b3646156510"><span data-lake-id="uf7352896" id="uf7352896" class="lake-fontsize-12">经历过几十年的风雨洗礼，C语言可谓风光无数，这世界上随处可见它的身影。但是，同时在一些人眼里，可能觉得C语言已是暮年(将近50岁)、老矣。</span></p><p data-lake-id="dc713b3da473839992fd2dfc73badb23" id="dc713b3da473839992fd2dfc73badb23" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560071132-5737d4aa-fd73-4e3e-99bf-1fa011fe772b.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A290%2C%22height%22%3A392%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A640%2C%22originHeight%22%3A866%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23dad8d3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LiCjC%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="5e78179b5f988cb2c99a2286a968a6d7" id="5e78179b5f988cb2c99a2286a968a6d7"><span data-lake-id="u0478b0f5" id="u0478b0f5" class="lake-fontsize-12">但是这么想就错了，根据TIOBE编程语言排行榜(</span><a href="https://www.tiobe.com/tiobe-index/" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u23ce19e4" id="u23ce19e4"><span data-lake-id="ud9714b59" id="ud9714b59" class="lake-fontsize-12">https://www.tiobe.com/tiobe-index/</span></a><span data-lake-id="ub678cfdc" id="ub678cfdc" class="lake-fontsize-12">)告诉你，C语言宝刀未老，还是那个风采耀眼的少年。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="Z4Z8h" id="Z4Z8h"><span data-lake-id="u64229f95" id="u64229f95">1.3 c语言优缺点</span></h2><p data-lake-id="b7bff753af1ed532ae9a6ac105511740" id="b7bff753af1ed532ae9a6ac105511740"><span data-lake-id="u0968cfa1" id="u0968cfa1" class="lake-fontsize-12">优点：</span></p><p data-lake-id="85c4edd9e25c2f8229583e32b64b684b" id="85c4edd9e25c2f8229583e32b64b684b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u917c063f" id="u917c063f" class="lake-fontsize-12">高效</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uaf6529e1" id="uaf6529e1" class="lake-fontsize-12"> ：高效性是C语言与生俱来的优点之一，发明C语言就是为 了编写那些以往由汇编语言编写的应用程序</span></p><p data-lake-id="d289a96cbfe3bbd9dc5f665f751288d4" id="d289a96cbfe3bbd9dc5f665f751288d4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5deed475" id="u5deed475" class="lake-fontsize-12">可移植</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8426b32d" id="u8426b32d" class="lake-fontsize-12"> ：虽然程序的可移植性并不是C语言的主要目标，但它还 是成为了C语言的优点之一，C语言没有分裂成不兼容的多种分支（这 要归功于C语言早期与UNIX系统的结合以及后来的ANSI/ISO标 准）。另一个原因是C语言编译器规模小且容易编写，这使得它们 得以广泛应用。最后，C语言自身的特性也支持可移植性</span></p><p data-lake-id="d8139e4697b8933353a8cc38782d9f95" id="d8139e4697b8933353a8cc38782d9f95"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubd57065f" id="ubd57065f" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能强大</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8c0a6f2c" id="u8c0a6f2c" class="lake-fontsize-12"> ：C语言拥有一个庞大的数据类型和运算符集合，这个 集合使得C语言具有强大的表达能力</span></p><p data-lake-id="f7736122f54a74cc960ffa4a2e024fff" id="f7736122f54a74cc960ffa4a2e024fff"><strong><span data-lake-id="u490bd728" id="u490bd728" class="lake-fontsize-12">灵活</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u011c811d" id="u011c811d" class="lake-fontsize-12"> ：虽然C语言最初设计是为了系统编程，但是没有固有的约 束将它限制在此范围内。C语言现在可以用于编写从嵌入式系统到 商业数据处理的各种应用程序。</span></p><p data-lake-id="6d6ff63513f99ef0b317a2c61449d787" id="6d6ff63513f99ef0b317a2c61449d787"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4294f02c" id="u4294f02c" class="lake-fontsize-12">标准库</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u27521df5" id="u27521df5" class="lake-fontsize-12"> ：C语言的一个突出优点就是它具有标准库，该标准库包 含了数百个可以用于输入/输出、字符串处理、存储分配以及其他 实用操作的函数</span></p><p data-lake-id="61f0521179353eae140eff529bedad2d" id="61f0521179353eae140eff529bedad2d"><strong><span data-lake-id="uff4fdf1b" id="uff4fdf1b" class="lake-fontsize-12">与UNIX系统的集成</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u59288bd8" id="u59288bd8" class="lake-fontsize-12"> ：C语言在与UNIX系统（包括广为人知的 Linux）结合方面特别强大。事实上，一些UNIX工具甚至假定用户 是了解C语言的</span></p><p data-lake-id="2d664d84aec4be47829221b96c79dacc" id="2d664d84aec4be47829221b96c79dacc"><span data-lake-id="ua1d5061e" id="ua1d5061e" class="lake-fontsize-12">缺点：</span></p><p data-lake-id="13d145b05421988e532dac4db3805a26" id="13d145b05421988e532dac4db3805a26"><strong><span data-lake-id="u315307ff" id="u315307ff" class="lake-fontsize-12">C程序更容易隐藏错误</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc9d83ccd" id="uc9d83ccd" class="lake-fontsize-12"> ：C语言的灵活性使得用它编程出错的概 率较高。在用其他语言编程时可以发现的错误，C语言编译器却无 法检查到。</span></p><p data-lake-id="eb59d0f7ddf8d9122cb7338caa937034" id="eb59d0f7ddf8d9122cb7338caa937034"><strong><span data-lake-id="u12785811" id="u12785811" class="lake-fontsize-12">C程序可能会难以理解</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1dee0487" id="u1dee0487" class="lake-fontsize-12"> ：C语言产生的时候正是人机交互最 为单调乏味的时期，因此设计者特意使C语言简明以便将录入和编 辑程序的用时减到最少。C语言的灵活性也可能是一个负面因素， 过于聪明的程序员甚至可以编写出除了他们自己几乎没人可以读 得懂的程序</span></p><p data-lake-id="843b7abd8190bb50314d85d3bff044b0" id="843b7abd8190bb50314d85d3bff044b0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6401ab8a" id="u6401ab8a" class="lake-fontsize-12">C程序可能会难以修改</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u166b2322" id="u166b2322" class="lake-fontsize-12">：用C语言编写的大规模程序将很难修改。现代的编程语言通常 都会提供“类”和“包”之类的语言特性，这样的特性可以把大 的程序分解成许多更容易管理的模块。遗憾的是，C语言恰恰缺少 这样的特性</span></p><p data-lake-id="dd42b18a189b58785f618f522d873878" id="dd42b18a189b58785f618f522d873878"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560071313-daaaf152-0e6d-4e12-89a1-4ef788964a7c.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A177%2C%22height%22%3A195%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A241%2C%22originHeight%22%3A265%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eeeae0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bdo9M%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="3558245543d9f51c4325eac799241b59" id="3558245543d9f51c4325eac799241b59"><span data-lake-id="uc7e960d0" id="uc7e960d0" class="lake-fontsize-12">每年 一次的国际模糊C代码大赛（International Obfuscated C CodeContest）竟然鼓励参赛者编写最难以理解的C程序，获奖程序可以到竞赛网站(</span><a href="https://www.ioccc.org/winners.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u4d37490f" id="u4d37490f"><span data-lake-id="u00280f6d" id="u00280f6d" class="lake-fontsize-12">www.ioccc.org</span></a><span data-lake-id="u172b8959" id="u172b8959" class="lake-fontsize-12">)获取</span></p><p data-lake-id="c9b8b644edb3c71402a970e483e5ca4f" id="c9b8b644edb3c71402a970e483e5ca4f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560071558-a91975c5-c3fd-4e41-ad70-f8a19680c786.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A474%2C%22height%22%3A373%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1080%2C%22originHeight%22%3A850%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%2328282d%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x3CM4%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="zvGpy" id="zvGpy"><span data-lake-id="u8f2dba93" id="u8f2dba93">1.4 高效使用C语言</span></h2><p data-lake-id="f3159d822651139ed3be56e460715018" id="f3159d822651139ed3be56e460715018"><span data-lake-id="ue0a7e6f5" id="ue0a7e6f5" class="lake-fontsize-12">高效地使用C语言要求在利用C语言优点的同时要避免它的缺点。下面 是一些建议</span></p><p data-lake-id="0dc54677d9bb516bf1f10dd0f299a96b" id="0dc54677d9bb516bf1f10dd0f299a96b"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufd45cf9f" id="ufd45cf9f" class="lake-fontsize-12">学习如何规避C语言的缺陷</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8f65d7ae" id="u8f65d7ae" class="lake-fontsize-12">：现代编译器可以检查到常见的 缺陷并且发出警告，但是没有一个编译器可以侦察出全部缺陷，包括咱们在日常代码中可能会经常出现错误，如果我们遇到很伤脑筋的错误，我们应该感到非常兴奋，因为解决了错误意味着对知识点理解就更深一步。</span></p><p data-lake-id="701b0d49ee297c0f5266f95be6738e0f" id="701b0d49ee297c0f5266f95be6738e0f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u278d58b2" id="u278d58b2" class="lake-fontsize-12">利用现有的代码库</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u79782615" id="u79782615" class="lake-fontsize-12">：使用C语言的一个好处是其他许多人也在使 用C。把别人编写好的代码用于自己的程序是一个非常好的主意。 C代码经常被打包成库（函数的集合）。获取适当的库既可以大大 减少错误，也可以节省相当多的编程工作，有些库是公用的，有些是开源的，而有些则是作为商 品销售的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="17d932592bb331ed058787c5a086469a" id="17d932592bb331ed058787c5a086469a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u73453bd4" id="u73453bd4" class="lake-fontsize-12">采用一套切合实际的编码规范</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u406a2c23" id="u406a2c23" class="lake-fontsize-12">：编码规范是一套设计风格准 则，即使语言本身没有强制要求，程序员也决定遵守。精心选择 的规范可以使程序更加统一，并且易于阅读和修改</span></p><p data-lake-id="3ab335fbbb0d08cbbfe7a2dece70bb3b" id="3ab335fbbb0d08cbbfe7a2dece70bb3b"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf6edba57" id="uf6edba57" class="lake-fontsize-12">避免“投机取巧”和极度复杂的代码</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u953990d4" id="u953990d4" class="lake-fontsize-12">：通常用C语言完成某项指定任务时会有多种解决途径，程序员 经常会尝试选择最简洁的方式。但是，千万不要没有节制，因为 最简略的解决方式往往也是最难以理解的</span></p><p data-lake-id="3e2502802a283ec1204d53e766870622" id="3e2502802a283ec1204d53e766870622"><strong><span data-lake-id="u05f5f0c8" id="u05f5f0c8" class="lake-fontsize-12">紧贴标准</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udd3f41dc" id="udd3f41dc" class="lake-fontsize-12">：大多数C编译器都提供不属于C89或C99标准的特性和 库函数。为了程序的可移植性，若非确有必要，最好避免使用这 些特性和库函数</span></p><p data-lake-id="95481e04ee75e130e4ccd22d294550aa" id="95481e04ee75e130e4ccd22d294550aa" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560071852-c60457e6-8aff-4d45-b2ec-857c184660c0.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A405%2C%22height%22%3A398%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A720%2C%22originHeight%22%3A708%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c5bfb2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rCk5K%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="62473e857caf184b4e0e32528df97d60" id="62473e857caf184b4e0e32528df97d60"><br></p><h1 data-lake-id="yqA2Q" id="yqA2Q"><span data-lake-id="u7e8cee3d" id="u7e8cee3d">2.环境搭建</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id="sQKfb" id="sQKfb"><span data-lake-id="u118c7ce0" id="u118c7ce0">2.1 Linux环境搭建</span></h2><p data-lake-id="25481e4c94b217d240225901c5f17b10" id="25481e4c94b217d240225901c5f17b10"><em><span data-lake-id="u631ab26a" id="u631ab26a" class="lake-fontsize-12">为什么要安装linux系统？</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="46ab5acf74daec28a3fe94bca067a630" id="46ab5acf74daec28a3fe94bca067a630"><span data-lake-id="u9bdc206e" id="u9bdc206e" class="lake-fontsize-12">开源，免费</span></p><p data-lake-id="2505ede9d16f9e78019384a9112fd550" id="2505ede9d16f9e78019384a9112fd550"><span data-lake-id="u052530c4" id="u052530c4" class="lake-fontsize-12">多用户、多任务、多线程</span></p><p data-lake-id="86b77bfda94522094402ceaf3b3fb372" id="86b77bfda94522094402ceaf3b3fb372"><span data-lake-id="u7991f00a" id="u7991f00a" class="lake-fontsize-12">稳定性和高效性，不出意外的情况下，Linux服务器可以无休止的运行下去不宕机，同时Linux操作系统能把服务器的硬件优势体现的淋漓尽致，保证了高效性</span></p><p data-lake-id="3f8ff623b8785395626a66d31783e915" id="3f8ff623b8785395626a66d31783e915"><span data-lake-id="u29aa1c96" id="u29aa1c96" class="lake-fontsize-12">安全性，得益于</span><span data-lake-id="uf60f8651" id="uf60f8651" class="lake-fontsize-12">Linux拥有相当庞大的用户和开源社区支持，因此能很快发现系统漏洞，并迅速发布安全补丁及时更新</span></p><p data-lake-id="2962a2da332730c231ffe37b71093dbe" id="2962a2da332730c231ffe37b71093dbe"><em><span data-lake-id="ufe8c7afb" id="ufe8c7afb" class="lake-fontsize-12">VMware虚拟机安装：</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="003ac2a8bd2fe9e6cce0ea86dcc9027d" id="003ac2a8bd2fe9e6cce0ea86dcc9027d"><span data-lake-id="u0a58cc7b" id="u0a58cc7b" class="lake-fontsize-12">通过虚拟机软件学习是初学者学习 Linux 的最佳方式，虚拟机模拟出来的 Linux 与真实的 Linux 几乎没有区别</span></p><p data-lake-id="b670dceea3692d98ddf7448b3643b2aa" id="b670dceea3692d98ddf7448b3643b2aa"><span data-lake-id="ud7c58137" id="ud7c58137" class="lake-fontsize-12"> VMWare虚拟机软件是一个“虚拟PC”软件，它使你可以在一台机器上同时运行二个或更多Windows、DOS、LINUX系统</span></p><p data-lake-id="1196e8d8e6e4446a0fe29b0e7a74a033" id="1196e8d8e6e4446a0fe29b0e7a74a033"><span data-lake-id="u718928fd" id="u718928fd" class="lake-fontsize-12">安装方式一：下载VMware，</span><a href="https://www.vmware.com/cn/products/workstation-pro.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u5d0f5be0" id="u5d0f5be0"><span data-lake-id="ua34da8cc" id="ua34da8cc" class="lake-fontsize-12">https://www.vmware.com/cn/products/workstation-pro.html</span></a><span data-lake-id="ufaf846e8" id="ufaf846e8" class="lake-fontsize-12">(window11 要下载最新版本的虚拟机)，详细安装步骤参考：</span><a href="https://blog.csdn.net/qq_62331938/article/details/127555738" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u5c52082a" id="u5c52082a"><span data-lake-id="u6d2075d3" id="u6d2075d3" class="lake-fontsize-12">https://blog.csdn.net/qq_62331938/article/details/127555738</span></a><span data-lake-id="u2a612300" id="u2a612300" class="lake-fontsize-12">，（安装路径不要有中文和特殊符号）</span></p><p data-lake-id="b0712719a5c920596b1821005b30dbea" id="b0712719a5c920596b1821005b30dbea"><span data-lake-id="u3dab5423" id="u3dab5423" class="lake-fontsize-12">安装方式二：将发的压缩包解压后，直接使用下一步安装大法即可。</span></p><p data-lake-id="5314c3524dd96272ec7bdafd890495c9" id="5314c3524dd96272ec7bdafd890495c9"><span data-lake-id="ub1202384" id="ub1202384" class="lake-fontsize-12">在虚拟机中安装linux</span></p><p data-lake-id="aaa697bca7ac9e3371b1c42e3938f2b1" id="aaa697bca7ac9e3371b1c42e3938f2b1"><span data-lake-id="u56dba59a" id="u56dba59a" class="lake-fontsize-12">获取ubuntu系统：</span><a href="https://releases.ubuntu.com/" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u1f0cbff6" id="u1f0cbff6"><span data-lake-id="u31fb338f" id="u31fb338f" class="lake-fontsize-12">https://releases.ubuntu.com/</span></a><span data-lake-id="u78cc5dba" id="u78cc5dba" class="lake-fontsize-12">                  </span><a href="http://mirrors.aliyun.com/ubuntu-releases/14.04/?spm=a2c6h.25603864.0.0.75fb4dda3OaFFN" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u37d5d001" id="u37d5d001"><span data-lake-id="u69a33b99" id="u69a33b99" class="lake-fontsize-12">http://mirrors.aliyun.com/ubuntu-releases/14.04/?spm=a2c6h.25603864.0.0.75fb4dda3OaFFN</span></a></p><p data-lake-id="1c38c4af479e8315a8d8f4600b222ced" id="1c38c4af479e8315a8d8f4600b222ced"><span data-lake-id="u81d6389c" id="u81d6389c" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="87b9695b569824ada156bc83700a298e" id="87b9695b569824ada156bc83700a298e"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560072100-1f84e455-3def-4fee-b2b1-6b10de8cc288.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A501%2C%22height%22%3A405%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A917%2C%22originHeight%22%3A742%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fdfcfc%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KUUya%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="3d14d0f94f0bdd75b66b360a3a0dba60" id="3d14d0f94f0bdd75b66b360a3a0dba60"><span data-lake-id="u57d16d75" id="u57d16d75" class="lake-fontsize-12">为了独立出linux系统与win10系统，需要单独划分出一个磁盘（存放linux系统文件）。</span></p><p data-lake-id="81033f3b0f44661c31a7b356f9474a8a" id="81033f3b0f44661c31a7b356f9474a8a"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560072331-2733b0cb-1d00-4b6b-a44b-e8f3f0c4e111.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A557%2C%22height%22%3A443%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A928%2C%22originHeight%22%3A738%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f3f3f2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eBL3M%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="a5e9ea82664502f99a5d7a8cbf2ac32c" id="a5e9ea82664502f99a5d7a8cbf2ac32c"><span data-lake-id="ue78d9d56" id="ue78d9d56" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="af1df5bb1f4c2068afbc1cad4cd419d7" id="af1df5bb1f4c2068afbc1cad4cd419d7"><span data-lake-id="u98f091d2" id="u98f091d2" class="lake-fontsize-12">网上linux安装参考教程：</span></p><p data-lake-id="f7f31787ec77e6db6568fe3c15bfec74" id="f7f31787ec77e6db6568fe3c15bfec74"><a href="https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_68955195/article/details/136690681" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u381ff5c3" id="u381ff5c3"><span data-lake-id="u2eb09817" id="u2eb09817" class="lake-fontsize-12">https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_68955195/article/details/136690681</span></a></p><p data-lake-id="4a80b9d16a98b5d3639ea44bc16732f4" id="4a80b9d16a98b5d3639ea44bc16732f4"><span data-lake-id="uc7fec4ad" id="uc7fec4ad" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="41eb9762951ce19f9e973c38da810318" id="41eb9762951ce19f9e973c38da810318"><span data-lake-id="ue53900e7" id="ue53900e7" class="lake-fontsize-12">解决屏幕大小不匹配的问题：</span></p><p data-lake-id="b7466e01c56cb89f8db3074c0d744a72" id="b7466e01c56cb89f8db3074c0d744a72"><span data-lake-id="u669046a7" id="u669046a7" class="lake-fontsize-12">（虚拟机选项卡）安装 vmware tools 工具，打开文件夹后，右击“Extract Here”（提取） ，复制到home/Downloads下，然后解压提取。</span></p><p data-lake-id="d2afb9b6bd2e112533946841cc527c22" id="d2afb9b6bd2e112533946841cc527c22"><span data-lake-id="u4dcb3def" id="u4dcb3def" class="lake-fontsize-12">按 ctrl+alt+t 快捷键唤出终端 ，  ls 列出当前目录下所有文件    cd   进入制定的目录</span></p><p data-lake-id="6f057feaa654ddd443442860f7e9453e" id="6f057feaa654ddd443442860f7e9453e"><span data-lake-id="u67e6254c" id="u67e6254c" class="lake-fontsize-12"> cd Downloads/vmware-tools-distrib/</span></p><p data-lake-id="a632cf946aec2dfdeba9642138b90897" id="a632cf946aec2dfdeba9642138b90897"><span data-lake-id="ue49a78cc" id="ue49a78cc" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="3d83d09518a3e7e30b22751124f0a8ed" id="3d83d09518a3e7e30b22751124f0a8ed"><span data-lake-id="u454c3a94" id="u454c3a94" class="lake-fontsize-12">sudo ./vmware-install.pl</span></p><p data-lake-id="85865e0fd98d7161fc2719eef5f7c95b" id="85865e0fd98d7161fc2719eef5f7c95b"><span data-lake-id="ua137350e" id="ua137350e" class="lake-fontsize-12">重启</span></p><p data-lake-id="59b79a77133a605fea3945d0ff2f95bf" id="59b79a77133a605fea3945d0ff2f95bf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560072538-490f2560-14aa-4572-8743-60438315a71b.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A583%2C%22height%22%3A308%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1855%2C%22originHeight%22%3A981%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fdfdfd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jl4uk%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="569ca353aa7b4e17de4e905557a7a5e9" id="569ca353aa7b4e17de4e905557a7a5e9"><span data-lake-id="u83c5f055" id="u83c5f055" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果出现linux桌面，说明安装成功</span></p><p data-lake-id="bfd079ea7fece785078019353756ff70" id="bfd079ea7fece785078019353756ff70"><span data-lake-id="uc462a82b" id="uc462a82b" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="1d7a690ea68fc623dc7fe5b59bbe8751" id="1d7a690ea68fc623dc7fe5b59bbe8751" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560073005-b7e608cb-4218-4c80-b528-df13a665955c.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A596%2C%22height%22%3A382%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1628%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1044%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23313c2f%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QVvqR%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="pr9KK" id="pr9KK"><span data-lake-id="ucc4b37fa" id="ucc4b37fa">2.2 VScode</span></h2><p data-lake-id="dfb9b7245f06e024eb990fe454077b26" id="dfb9b7245f06e024eb990fe454077b26"><span data-lake-id="u87fbf9eb" id="u87fbf9eb" class="lake-fontsize-12">在日常项目开发</span><u><span data-lake-id="u99e38f6d" id="u99e38f6d" class="lake-fontsize-12">中</span></u><span data-lake-id="u1f0ec7ae" id="u1f0ec7ae" class="lake-fontsize-12">，经常需要连接到远程（或本地虚拟机）的编译主机，去编辑工程代码，比如下面经典的嵌入式开发模式：</span></p><p data-lake-id="b78ce47a04bd47f3afab5fdfbfc9b052" id="b78ce47a04bd47f3afab5fdfbfc9b052" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560073231-10586693-cb91-4e5b-8f7e-2ef2bf97d73b.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A541%2C%22height%22%3A277%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A944%2C%22originHeight%22%3A483%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ec5DA%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="cdd18de30713f702f58ce8805778f9b9" id="cdd18de30713f702f58ce8805778f9b9"><span data-lake-id="uf3b5ed55" id="uf3b5ed55" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="cbc8c3ea079719359a65d2988d39e337" id="cbc8c3ea079719359a65d2988d39e337" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u0dbbd7b5" id="u0dbbd7b5" class="lake-fontsize-12">在上面场景中，一般会让在 Windows 中运行的 vsCode 远程连接到ubuntu上，然后进行编辑工作，这个工作需要让vsCode和ubuntu两端都安装 SSH 服务，但是首先需要安装VScode软件：</span></p><p data-lake-id="70cfec508c4eebd2eb4c63c5b4f48ca5" id="70cfec508c4eebd2eb4c63c5b4f48ca5"><span data-lake-id="u8537920a" id="u8537920a" class="lake-fontsize-12">进入官网</span><a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/Download" target="_blank" data-lake-id="ud045d090" id="ud045d090"><span data-lake-id="u96b9cceb" id="u96b9cceb" class="lake-fontsize-12">https://code.visualstudio.com/Download</span></a><span data-lake-id="u40df96f4" id="u40df96f4" class="lake-fontsize-12">，根据电脑的系统与所需版本点击下载链接（一般情况下点击Windows按钮即可）（快速下载路线：</span><a href="https://wwx.lanzoui.com/i2AAkmyrrmh" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u97be5fc5" id="u97be5fc5"><span data-lake-id="u13a970d5" id="u13a970d5" class="lake-fontsize-12">https://wwx.lanzoui.com/i2AAkmyrrmh</span></a><span data-lake-id="u61d21c1f" id="u61d21c1f" class="lake-fontsize-12">）</span></p><p data-lake-id="a97eff73e5ae50e8b51a9ae401b669a2" id="a97eff73e5ae50e8b51a9ae401b669a2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560073397-a38894a2-d8f1-4e58-a31d-85710005db01.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A628%2C%22height%22%3A256%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1273%2C%22originHeight%22%3A519%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QypOA%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="359f492de26ec121fc9e188038fc64f8" id="359f492de26ec121fc9e188038fc64f8"><span data-lake-id="u41693c75" id="u41693c75" class="lake-fontsize-12">点击安装包，下一步大法即可</span></p><p data-lake-id="cf1cfee2dc87cd7c576607822c48af9c" id="cf1cfee2dc87cd7c576607822c48af9c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560073570-17b51db2-d582-4b4b-87bd-034fe887e245.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A381%2C%22height%22%3A312%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A582%2C%22originHeight%22%3A476%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e9e7e7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xGqFB%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="061f578f072e4ee8282887750f54eda9" id="061f578f072e4ee8282887750f54eda9"><span data-lake-id="u12f25ddb" id="u12f25ddb" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="28a98be636121bc7a614ffb594fc3b42" id="28a98be636121bc7a614ffb594fc3b42"><span data-lake-id="u0f249d2d" id="u0f249d2d" class="lake-fontsize-12">在vsCode安装SSH服务SSH是vsCode的一款插件，直接在扩展栏中搜索并安装</span></p><p data-lake-id="594790d93941408eefb6f2d4ac313974" id="594790d93941408eefb6f2d4ac313974" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560073804-4dffeb55-1559-4757-9eeb-65070fe49865.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A543%2C%22height%22%3A369%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1209%2C%22originHeight%22%3A821%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e9e8e8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vJOT9%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="134dfedd1cb2ede4c1e0beb0e860a0b4" id="134dfedd1cb2ede4c1e0beb0e860a0b4"><span data-lake-id="u073b2631" id="u073b2631" class="lake-fontsize-12">在ubunntu安装SSH服务只需要执行如下命令即可：</span></p><p data-lake-id="326c0390b5701d04e5244740470cbf5b" id="326c0390b5701d04e5244740470cbf5b"><span data-lake-id="uec76d670" id="uec76d670" class="lake-fontsize-12">liuth@ubuntu:~$ sudo apt install ssh</span></p><p data-lake-id="8d6730b06c17f5f0d3ecc5738d50d7f9" id="8d6730b06c17f5f0d3ecc5738d50d7f9"><span data-lake-id="ua132f2f5" id="ua132f2f5" class="lake-fontsize-12">初次使用apt 的时候，我们要先设置网络下载源：</span></p><p data-lake-id="7055cf38c2776612271eb5e27129933f" id="7055cf38c2776612271eb5e27129933f"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560074025-815f2a9b-1ed6-456c-a06e-1b08e7d84b91.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A525%2C%22height%22%3A315%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1002%2C%22originHeight%22%3A601%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c2c1c0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z1tZ5%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="d657d17db3f9f3abd98089cf2148b3db" id="d657d17db3f9f3abd98089cf2148b3db"><span data-lake-id="u7507bee4" id="u7507bee4" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="7a1d5d86207ddd8093b3641a931d4246" id="7a1d5d86207ddd8093b3641a931d4246"><span data-lake-id="u5e093f37" id="u5e093f37" class="lake-fontsize-12">设置好后，更新apt 即可：</span></p><p data-lake-id="050bfbc0fbb1272fc07c90ec879e5bd6" id="050bfbc0fbb1272fc07c90ec879e5bd6"><span data-lake-id="u3ad883f3" id="u3ad883f3" class="lake-fontsize-12">sudo apt update</span></p><p data-lake-id="ddba8d5e0752929deaa74bacb688380f" id="ddba8d5e0752929deaa74bacb688380f"><span data-lake-id="u839f93dd" id="u839f93dd" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="28a56c79ff3461350985391deb103443" id="28a56c79ff3461350985391deb103443"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560074249-78beea9e-6a53-4ad9-8c90-6eb6e3c3223a.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A893%2C%22originHeight%22%3A283%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23310a26%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ii0xr%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="41f1f1c6de9f7a4ee81084e141deea51" id="41f1f1c6de9f7a4ee81084e141deea51"><span data-lake-id="ua1b12708" id="ua1b12708" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="50a0b09604ac057a2f96fedd7396fd59" id="50a0b09604ac057a2f96fedd7396fd59"><span data-lake-id="ua9ce6a51" id="ua9ce6a51" class="lake-fontsize-12">vsCode连接ubuntu：在VScode中打开一个新窗口，点击左下角的远程窗口图标</span></p><p data-lake-id="a315a7a91d55f1023cbc6d80ef539128" id="a315a7a91d55f1023cbc6d80ef539128" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560074440-4fec9a58-29a2-406e-ba98-41982a7eb974.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A475%2C%22height%22%3A412%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A913%2C%22originHeight%22%3A791%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f2f2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AEeGw%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="90a14f8fc1c77a44f939d96769cdd2bf" id="90a14f8fc1c77a44f939d96769cdd2bf"><span data-lake-id="u06e494a3" id="u06e494a3" class="lake-fontsize-12">在弹出的窗口中，选择 Connect to Host :</span></p><p data-lake-id="5ba4c39b99b4191145de4f253443895e" id="5ba4c39b99b4191145de4f253443895e"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560074675-6fe9ad07-ce85-4cad-9d4a-c8d6a8c7eb79.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A522%2C%22height%22%3A452%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A913%2C%22originHeight%22%3A791%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f0f0f0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sV1TA%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="d37b9efeb74bcea741a974e35e7ef33c" id="d37b9efeb74bcea741a974e35e7ef33c"><span data-lake-id="u1644b0db" id="u1644b0db" class="lake-fontsize-12">增加一个新的远程主机（添加主机后会保持记录，下一次登录就不需要新增加了）</span></p><p data-lake-id="ae8308aa9c3630518242f42c896ea702" id="ae8308aa9c3630518242f42c896ea702" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560074850-80e33203-1678-453d-a84b-4012e17ed817.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A715%2C%22height%22%3A332%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A847%2C%22originHeight%22%3A393%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ededed%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22te26F%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="65bab9b7a6e9ff2e43d933ce022f634e" id="65bab9b7a6e9ff2e43d933ce022f634e"><span data-lake-id="u0ccf1887" id="u0ccf1887" class="lake-fontsize-12">在弹出的编辑框中填入主机信息（查看linux的ip地址命令：ifconfig）</span></p><p data-lake-id="b41f429b844a875c0efd41e6903a97fe" id="b41f429b844a875c0efd41e6903a97fe" style="text-align: cent